{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.StandardModel.ColourStabilizerAction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ColourStabilizerAction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.FiniteDimensional.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.FreeModule.Finite.Matrix","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.colour_needs_three_strands","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.colour_needs_three_strands","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ColourStabilizerAction.lean#L61-L74","doc":"**Three strands are the minimal colour host** (proved): an\n8-dimensional colour algebra — the dimension of the octonion\nstabilizer under the corpus's `finrank su3 = 8` gate — admits no\nfaithful linear action on a state space of dimension ≤ 2, since\n`2² = 4 < 8 ≤ 3² = 9`. The framework's choice of a 3-strand state\nspace is thus the smallest one on which colour can act faithfully. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.not_colourStabilizerAction_of_dim_sq_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.not_colourStabilizerAction_of_dim_sq_lt","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ColourStabilizerAction.lean#L47-L59","doc":"**Dimension obstruction** (proved): a faithful linear action\nforces `finrank g ≤ (finrank V)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ColourStabilizerAction.faithful_linear_action","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ColourStabilizerAction.faithful_linear_action","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ColourStabilizerAction.lean#L45-L45","doc":"The colour algebra embeds linearly in the endomorphisms of `V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ColourStabilizerAction.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ColourStabilizerAction.mk","kind":"ctor","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ColourStabilizerAction.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.ColourStabilizerAction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.ColourStabilizerAction","kind":"class","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/StandardModel/ColourStabilizerAction.lean#L30-L45","doc":"**Conjecture (colour stabilizer action).** The colour algebra `g`\n(intended: the octonion stabilizer `su3 e`, 8-dimensional by the\ncorpus gate) acts faithfully and linearly on the state space `V`\n(intended: the 3-strand state space): there is an injective linear\nmap `g →ₗ End(V)`. Bracket compatibility is the obvious\nstrengthening; it is deliberately not required here — bracket\n*closure* of the concrete stabilizer is proved\n(`QOU.MathlibExt.OctonionSU3BracketClosure.bracketDer_mem_su3`), but\nrequiring `Φ` to intertwine brackets would strengthen the conjecture\nbeyond what the appendix's gap ledger records as the minimal missing\ningredient. No instance is provided for the intended instantiation —\nproviding one is the open derivation. ","signatureChunk":0}]}